A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%BC%82%E6%AD%A5%E5%8F%91%E9%80%81%E9%9C%80%E8%A6%81%E5%88%A0%E9%99%A4KEY%E5%88%B0MQ%22%2C%22x%22%3A608%2C%22y%22%3A383%2C%22width%22%3A231%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E7%9B%91%E5%90%AC%E7%9A%84MQ%2C%E8%BF%9B%E8%A1%8C%E9%87%8D%E6%96%B0%E5%88%A0%E9%99%A4%22%2C%22x%22%3A455%2C%22y%22%3A121%2C%22width%22%3A220%2C%22height%22%3A25%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%8F%B7%22%2C%22x%22%3A1188%2C%22y%22%3A161%2C%22width%22%3A82%2C%22height%22%3A96%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%88%A0%E9%99%A4%E5%A4%B1%E8%B4%A5%22%2C%22x%22%3A646%2C%22y%22%3A362%2C%22width%22%3A135%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%223%22%2C%22x%22%3A839%2C%22y%22%3A227%2C%22width%22%3A89%2C%22height%22%3A94%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%85%88%E6%93%8D%E4%BD%9C%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E5%BA%93%22%2C%22x%22%3A607%2C%22y%22%3A43%2C%22width%22%3A110%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E7%BA%BF%E7%A8%8B2%22%2C%22x%22%3A149%2C%22y%22%3A456%2C%22width%22%3A70%2C%22height%22%3A28%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%88%A0%E9%99%A4%E7%BC%93%E5%AD%98%22%2C%22x%22%3A970%2C%22y%22%3A611%2C%22width%22%3A94%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%9F%A5%E8%AF%A2%E7%BC%93%E5%AD%98%22%2C%22x%22%3A304%2C%22y%22%3A461%2C%22width%22%3A85%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E7%BA%BF%E7%A8%8B1%22%2C%22x%22%3A146%2C%22y%22%3A156%2C%22width%22%3A71%2C%22height%22%3A30%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f8f7f7%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22uad8aa07f%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><p data-lake-id=\"u780ac667\" id=\"u780ac667\"><br></p><h1 data-lake-id=\"oeVsQ\" id=\"oeVsQ\"><span data-lake-id=\"u08e68035\" id=\"u08e68035\">总结：</span></h1><p data-lake-id=\"ufcb045eb\" id=\"ufcb045eb\" style=\"text-align: left\"><span data-lake-id=\"ubea31353\" id=\"ubea31353\" class=\"lake-fontsize-18\">1、对于并发几率很小的数据(如个人维度的订单数据、用户数据等)，这种几乎不用考虑这个问题，很少会发生缓存不一致，可以给缓存数据加上过期时间，每隔一段时间触发读的主动更新即可。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u921083c7\" id=\"u921083c7\" style=\"text-align: left\"><span data-lake-id=\"u4f4a79ce\" id=\"u4f4a79ce\" class=\"lake-fontsize-18\">2、就算并发很高，如果业务上能容忍短时间的缓存数据不一致(如商品名称，商品分类菜单等)，缓存加上过期时间依然可以解决大部分业务对于缓存的要求。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u015437ff\" id=\"u015437ff\" style=\"text-align: left\"><span data-lake-id=\"u83367bae\" id=\"u83367bae\" class=\"lake-fontsize-18\">3、如果不能容忍缓存数据不一致，可以通过加</span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ue642c21f\" id=\"ue642c21f\" class=\"lake-fontsize-18\">分布式读写锁</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"ubb8bcbb9\" id=\"ubb8bcbb9\" class=\"lake-fontsize-18\">保证并发读写或写写的时候按顺序排好队，</span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u0520a748\" id=\"u0520a748\" class=\"lake-fontsize-18\">读读的时候相当于无锁</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u8ad6308a\" id=\"u8ad6308a\" class=\"lake-fontsize-18\">。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"uc6515821\" id=\"uc6515821\" style=\"text-align: left\"><span data-lake-id=\"u8f90d3e6\" id=\"u8f90d3e6\" class=\"lake-fontsize-18\">4、也可以用阿里开源的canal通过监听数据库的binlog日志及时的去修改缓存，但是引入了新的中间件，增加了系统的复杂度。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u6387ff41\" id=\"u6387ff41\" style=\"text-align: left\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fpng%2F26817902%2F1728480996477-435ccaf5-632b-4672-99e3-ea93913740cb.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22ue24e0405-380e-41f3-95a9-31e5c460e0c%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u84a5e3a3-5228-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A818.9999694824219%2C%22height%22%3A652%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A36789%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A506%2C%22originHeight%22%3A403%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.100000023841858%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%9B%B4%E6%96%B0REDIS%E7%BC%93%E5%AD%98%22%2C%22x%22%3A334%2C%22y%22%3A172%2C%22width%22%3A102%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22STOCK%3D10%22%2C%22x%22%3A46%2C%22y%22%3A188%2C%22width%22%3A72%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%86%99%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E5%BA%93%22%2C%22x%22%3A47%2C%22y%22%3A166%2C%22width%22%3A68%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E7%9B%91%E5%90%AC%E4%B8%80%22%2C%22x%22%3A260%2C%22y%22%3A331%2C%22width%22%3A63%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22BINLOG%22%2C%22x%22%3A161%2C%22y%22%3A333%2C%22width%22%3A52%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22CANAL%22%2C%22x%22%3A363%2C%22y%22%3A334%2C%22width%22%3A45%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E7%BA%BF%E7%A8%8B1%22%2C%22x%22%3A59%2C%22y%22%3A62%2C%22width%22%3A42%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f7f6f5%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u342c5841%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><p data-lake-id=\"u4f63fa81\" id=\"u4f63fa81\"><br></p>", "format": "lake", "word_count": 543, "description": "1.1读取数据  逻辑如下：1.2写数据流程先删除缓存在更新数据库先更新数据库在删除缓存先操作缓存数据库不一致解决办法：延迟双删1.先删除缓存。2.写数据库。3.休眠多少毫秒，在删除缓存。这样子最多其他线程在这个时间段读取的脏数据。注意：咱们用redis一定是为了提供性能，所以这里的所有方案都...", "updated_at": "2025-04-20T14:39:18.000Z", "created_at": "2025-04-20T14:39:00.000Z", "id": 216261302, "status": 1}